@MesIngestHost = http://localhost:5089

### Read the bounded current operational attention page
GET {{MesIngestHost}}/api/v2/current-ingest-attention?pageSize=100&pageNumber=1
Accept: application/json

### Read one atomic Watch overview for selected MES areas
GET {{MesIngestHost}}/api/v2/watch-overview?area=A1-1&area=N3-3
Accept: application/json

### Current attention rejects an out-of-range page size with a stable V2 error
GET {{MesIngestHost}}/api/v2/current-ingest-attention?pageSize=201&pageNumber=1
Accept: application/json

### Watch overview rejects malformed MES areas with a stable V2 error
GET {{MesIngestHost}}/api/v2/watch-overview?area=not-an-area
Accept: application/json
